{"id":"653351","name":"酸甜南瓜藕","author":"冬季心情","authorId":"8473848","desc":"","cover":"images/653351/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"南瓜","amount":"90g"},{"name":"藕","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蜂蜜","amount":"20g"},{"name":"米醋","amount":"40g"},{"name":"玉米粒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"适量"},{"name":"喷雾橄榄油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"原料：南瓜，藕，玉米粒，枸杞。","img":"images/653351/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"南瓜切片，藕去皮切片。","img":"images/653351/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中烧开水，南瓜下锅煮熟捞出。","img":"images/653351/step_3.jpeg"},{"step":4,"desc":"藕片下锅，加入少许的白醋，可以保持藕的白色，藕片煮熟捞出。","img":"images/653351/step_4.jpeg"},{"step":5,"desc":"南瓜和藕片，如图摆盘。","img":"images/653351/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备一个碗，加入盐。","img":"images/653351/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入米醋。","img":"images/653351/step_7.jpeg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入蜂蜜，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/653351/step_8.jpeg"},{"step":9,"desc":"南瓜藕片上撒玉米粒和枸杞，料汁淋在上面。","img":"images/653351/step_9.jpeg"},{"step":10,"desc":"喷雾橄榄油喷点橄榄油即可。","img":"images/653351/step_10.jpeg"},{"step":11,"desc":"上桌喽。","img":"images/653351/step_11.jpeg"}],"tips":"藕片和南瓜要煮熟。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}